an Tidak Ditemukan | The Choco Studios</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n  <style>\n    :root { color-scheme: dark; --bg: #080b14; --panel: #111625; --text: #eef2ff; --muted: #a0aac2; --blue: #638cff; --purple: #a16bff; }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; padding: 24px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #171d35 0%, var(--bg) 62%); color: var(--text); font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif; }\n    main { width: min(100%, 640px); padding: clamp(28px, 7vw, 56px); text-align: center; border: 1px solid #2a3249; border-radius: 24px; background: rgba(17, 22, 37, .9); box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .28); }\n    .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; margin-bottom: 36px; text-align: left; }\n    .mark { display: grid; width: 44px; height: 44px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #343d5b; border-radius: 13px; background: #0b1020; color: #a5b8ff; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -1px; }\n    .brand-name { display: block; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.3px; }\n    .brand-sub { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }\n    .code { margin: 0; background: linear-gradient(115deg, var(--blue), var(--purple)); background-clip: text; color: transparent; font-size: clamp(76px, 18vw, 124px); font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -.08em; line-height: 1; }\n    h1 { margin: 20px 0 12px; font-size: clamp(25px, 4vw, 34px); letter-spacing: -.7px; }\n    p { max-width: 430px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; }\n    .actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 30px; }\n    a { min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0 18px; border: 1px solid #38435f; border-radius: 12px; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 650; }\n    a.primary { border-color: transparent; background: linear-gradient(115deg, #648bff, #a76cff); color: #080b14; }\n    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #b9c8ff; outline-offset: 4px; }\n    .footnote { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 13px; }\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { main { animation: enter .35s ease-out both; } @keyframes enter { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } } }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"The Choco Studios, kembali ke beranda\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TCS</span>\n      <span><span class=\"brand-name\">The Choco Studios</span><span class=\"brand-sub\">Pusat Informasi</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <p class=\"code\" aria-label=\"Error 404\">404</p>\n    <h1>Halaman tidak ditemukan</h1>\n    <p>Tautan yang dibuka mungkin sudah berubah, salah alamat, atau halaman tersebut memang belum tersedia.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <a class=\"primary\" href=\"/\">Kembali ke beranda</a>\n      <a href=\"mailto:thechocostudios@gmail.com?subject=Laporkan%20tautan%20rusak\">Laporkan tautan rusak</a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"footnote\">The Choco Studios · Pusat Informasi</p>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","encoding":"utf-8"},"_headers":{"data":"/*\n  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff\n  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin\n  X-Frame-Options: DENY\n  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()\n","encoding":"utf-8"},"favicon.svg":{"data":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\">\n  <title>The Choco Studios</title>\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"brand\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#638cff\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#a16bff\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#080b14\" stroke=\"#303952\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <path d=\"M12 18h40\" stroke=\"url(#brand)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <text x=\"32\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\"-1.2\" fill=\"url(#brand)\">TCS</text>\n</svg>\n","encoding":"utf-8"},"robots.txt":{"data":"User-agent: *\nAllow: /\n\nSitemap: https://tcs-information-hub.vercel.app/sitemap.xml\n","encoding":"utf-8"},"sitemap.xml":{"data":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<urlset xmlns=\"http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9\">\n  <url><loc>https://tcs-information-hub.vercel.app/</loc><lastmod>2026-11-05</lastmod><changefreq>weekly</changefreq><priority>1.0</priority></url>\n  <url><loc>https://tcs-information-hub.vercel.app/products/choco-ai.html</loc><lastmod>2026-11-05</lastmod><changefreq>monthly</changefreq><priority>0.5</priority></url>\n  <url><loc>https://tcs-information-hub.vercel.app/products/choco-ai-help-center.html</loc><lastmod>2026-11-05</lastmod><changefreq>monthly</changefreq><priority>0.5</priority></url>\n  <url><loc>https://tcs-information-hub.vercel.app/products/tcs-linkguard.html</loc><lastmod>2026-11-05</lastmod><changefreq>monthly</changefreq><priority>0.7</priority></url>\n</urlset>\n","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/about.html":{"data":"<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">Tentang TCS</p><h2 id=\"about-title\">Studio independen. Arah lintas bidang.</h2>\n<p class=\"section-intro\">The Choco Studios (TCS) adalah studio kreatif independen multisektor yang didirikan, dimiliki, dan dikelola secara mandiri oleh Hasby Prasetya Saprudin. TCS bukan kolektif yang menaungi seluruh kreator independen, bukan marketplace, dan bukan platform umum untuk memamerkan karya pihak lain.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"about-facts-grid\">\n<article class=\"about-fact-card\"><span class=\"about-card-label\">Perjalanan dimulai</span><h3 data-site-text=\"founded\">12 Desember 2023</h3><p>Berawal dari proyek yang kini bernama TCS LinkGuard.</p></article>\n<article class=\"about-fact-card\"><span class=\"about-card-label\">Pendiri &amp; pemilik</span><h3 data-site-text=\"founder\">Hasby Prasetya Saprudin</h3><p>Pendiri dan pengelola independen The Choco Studios.</p><a class=\"text-link founder-profile-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hasby-prasetya-tcs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Profil LinkedIn pendiri <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article>\n<article class=\"about-fact-card\"><span class=\"about-card-label\">Model pengembangan</span><h3>Open-source &amp; kolaborasi</h3><p>Kontribusi publik hanya dibuka pada proyek yang secara khusus ditetapkan menerima kontribusi.</p></article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"about-purpose-grid\">\n<article class=\"about-purpose-card about-vision-card\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">Arah strategis</p><h3>Membangun teknologi terbuka dan karya lintas bidang.</h3><p>TCS memprioritaskan open-source, pengembangan teknologi, dokumentasi, tata kelola proyek, serta kolaborasi yang terstruktur. Aplikasi tetap dapat dikembangkan, tetapi bukan lagi pusat utama strategi.</p></article>\n<article class=\"about-purpose-card\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">Prinsip</p><h3>Independensi dan integritas.</h3><p class=\"about-values\">Kualitas · Privasi · Kepercayaan · Atribusi kontributor · Perlindungan merek</p><p class=\"about-muted\">Lisensi kode, hak cipta kontributor, merek TCS, dan kewenangan rilis resmi diperlakukan secara terpisah.</p></article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-subhead\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">Ekosistem</p><h3>Integrasi lintas sektor yang tetap menjaga identitas.</h3></div></div>\n<div class=\"about-bottom-grid\"><article class=\"about-bottom-card\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">Sheeblink</p><h3>Inisiatif handmade dalam ekosistem TCS.</h3><p>Sheeblink telah diintegrasikan ke dalam ekosistem TCS sebagai bagian dari perluasan aktivitas ke bidang non-teknologi. Identitas kreatif dan karya handmade Sheeblink tetap dikenali.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/ecosystem/sheeblink/\">Lihat Sheeblink <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article>\n<article class=\"about-bottom-card\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">Jangkauan</p><h3>Berangkat dari Indonesia.</h3><p>TCS dikelola secara independen dan mengembangkan karya dengan orientasi jangka panjang serta jangkauan internasional.</p><p class=\"about-muted\">Kontak resmi: <a href=\"mailto:thechocostudios@gmail.com\">thechocostudios@gmail.com</a></p></article></div>\n</div></section>","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/contact.html":{"data":"<section class=\"section\" id=\"contact\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"contact-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">Kontak resmi</p><h2 id=\"contact-title\">Hubungi The Choco Studios.</h2><p class=\"section-intro\">Untuk pertanyaan umum, dukungan, kerja sama, atau pengajuan kontribusi pada proyek yang terbuka, gunakan kanal resmi berikut.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"contact-grid\">\n<a class=\"contact-method\" data-link-key=\"email\" href=\"mailto:thechocostudios@gmail.com\"><span class=\"contact-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">@</span><span class=\"contact-method-copy\"><strong>Email</strong><small>thechocostudios@gmail.com</small></span><span class=\"contact-method-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"contact-method\" data-link-key=\"contactFormUrl\" href=\"https://forms.gle/LUtY9cyFQKVizA1A6\"><span class=\"contact-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><span class=\"contact-method-copy\"><strong>Formulir kontak</strong><small>Kirim pesan melalui formulir resmi</small></span><span class=\"contact-method-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"contact-method\" data-link-key=\"helpCenterUrl\" href=\"https://choco-ai-help-center.vercel.app/\"><span class=\"contact-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">?</span><span class=\"contact-method-copy\"><strong>Pusat bantuan</strong><small>Artikel panduan dan Sara AI</small></span><span class=\"contact-method-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"contact-method\" data-link-key=\"linkedinUrl\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hasby-prasetya-tcs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"contact-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">in</span><span class=\"contact-method-copy\"><strong>LinkedIn pendiri</strong><small>Hasby Prasetya Saprudin</small></span><span class=\"contact-method-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contact-bottom\"><span>Ingin berkontribusi pada proyek yang terbuka?</span><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/bergabung/\">Baca panduan bergabung <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n</div></section>","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/footer.html":{"data":"<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container footer-main\">\n<div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"brand footer-brand-link\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"The Choco Studios, kembali ke atas\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" data-site-text=\"shortName\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TCS</span><span class=\"brand-copy\"><span class=\"brand-name\" data-site-text=\"brand\">The Choco Studios</span><span class=\"brand-sub\">Studio kreatif independen</span></span></a><p>Studio independen yang berfokus pada open-source dan karya lintas bidang.</p></div>\n<div class=\"footer-group\"><strong>Jelajahi</strong><a href=\"#projects\">Open-source</a><a href=\"#about\">Tentang TCS</a><a href=\"#products\">Ekosistem</a><a href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/bergabung/\">Bergabung</a></div>\n<div class=\"footer-group\"><strong>Informasi</strong><a href=\"#safety\">Tata kelola</a><a href=\"#updates\">Pembaruan</a><a href=\"#contact\">Kontak</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"container footer-bottom\"><span>© <span id=\"year\"></span> <span data-site-text=\"brand\">The Choco Studios</span>.</span><span>Didirikan dan dikelola secara independen oleh Hasby Prasetya Saprudin.</span></div></footer>","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/header.html":{"data":"<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"topbar-inner\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"The Choco Studios, beranda\">\n      <span class=\"brand-mark\" data-site-text=\"shortName\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TCS</span>\n      <span class=\"brand-copy\">\n        <span class=\"brand-name\" data-site-text=\"brand\">The Choco Studios</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-sub\">Studio kreatif independen</span>\n      </span>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Navigasi utama\"></nav>\n    <a class=\"header-cta\" data-link-key=\"chocoAiUrl\" href=\"https://choco-ai-independent-seven.vercel.app/\">\n      <span>Buka Choco AI</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <button class=\"menu-toggle\" id=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Buka menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\">\n      <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path class=\"menu-icon-lines\" d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path class=\"menu-icon-close\" d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/hero.html":{"data":"<section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n  <div class=\"container hero-layout\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">THE CHOCO STUDIOS <span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> INDEPENDENT CREATIVE STUDIO</div>\n      <h1 id=\"hero-title\">Open ideas.<br><span class=\"gradient-text\">Real contributions.</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-description\">The Choco Studios (TCS) adalah studio kreatif independen multisektor yang didirikan, dimiliki, dan dikelola secara mandiri oleh Hasby Prasetya Saprudin. Fokus TCS adalah open-source, teknologi terapan, dokumentasi, pemeliharaan proyek, dan kolaborasi lintas bidang.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n        <a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"#projects\">Jelajahi open-source <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/bergabung/\">Bergabung <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-footnote\"><span class=\"hero-footnote-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Studio independen yang didirikan, dimiliki, dan dikelola oleh Hasby Prasetya Saprudin.</div>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"hero-route-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"quick-nav-title\">\n      <div class=\"hero-route-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">Akses langsung</p><h2 id=\"quick-nav-title\">Jelajahi ekosistem TCS.</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"hero-route-list\">\n        <a class=\"hero-route-link\" href=\"#projects\"><span class=\"route-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><span class=\"route-copy\"><strong>Open-source</strong><small>Proyek dan prinsip kontribusi</small></span><span class=\"route-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"hero-route-link\" href=\"#about\"><span class=\"route-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><span class=\"route-copy\"><strong>Tentang TCS</strong><small>Studio, pendiri, dan arah strategis</small></span><span class=\"route-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"hero-route-link\" href=\"#products\"><span class=\"route-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><span class=\"route-copy\"><strong>Ekosistem</strong><small>Komponen lintas bidang</small></span><span class=\"route-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"hero-route-link\" href=\"#contact\"><span class=\"route-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><span class=\"route-copy\"><strong>Kontak</strong><small>Kanal resmi dan dukungan</small></span><span class=\"route-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-route-footer\"><a href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/bergabung/\">Panduan kontribusi <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"#updates\">Pembaruan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</section>","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/overview.html":{"data":"<section class=\"intro-strip\" aria-label=\"Ringkasan The Choco Studios\"><div class=\"container intro-strip-grid\">\n<div class=\"intro-fact\"><span class=\"intro-fact-label\">Identitas</span><strong>Studio kreatif independen</strong><p>Didirikan, dimiliki, dan dikelola oleh Hasby Prasetya Saprudin.</p></div>\n<div class=\"intro-fact\"><span class=\"intro-fact-label\">Fokus utama</span><strong>Open-source</strong><p>Perangkat lunak terbuka, dokumentasi, dan pemeliharaan proyek.</p></div>\n<div class=\"intro-fact\"><span class=\"intro-fact-label\">Ekosistem</span><strong>Lintas bidang</strong><p>Teknologi dan inisiatif kreatif, termasuk karya handmade Sheeblink.</p></div>\n</div></section>","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/products.html":{"data":"<section class=\"section section-products\" id=\"products\" aria-labelledby=\"products-title\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head section-head-row\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">Komponen ekosistem</p><h2 id=\"products-title\">Karya dan inisiatif TCS.</h2><p class=\"section-intro\">Bagian ini bukan katalog 16 aplikasi. TCS menampilkan komponen utama ekosistem yang relevan dengan arah pengembangan saat ini.</p></div><a class=\"section-head-link\" href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/\">Situs resmi TCS <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"product-grid\" id=\"product-list\"><article class=\"product-card\"><h3>Memuat informasi ekosistem…</h3></article></div></div></section>","encoding":"utf-8"},"components/projects.html":{"data":"<section class=\"section\" id=\"projects\" aria-labelledby=\"projects-title\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">Open-source &amp; pengembangan</p><h2 id=\"projects-title\">Kontribusi yang ditinjau. Proyek yang dijaga.</h2><p class=\"section-intro\">TCS mengembangkan dan memelihara proyek secara independen. Kontribusi publik hanya diterima pada repositori yang secara eksplisit menyatakan terbuka untuk kontribusi.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"projects-grid\">\n<article class=\"project-row\"><span class=\"project-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LG</span><div class=\"project-copy\"><h3>TCS LinkGuard</h3><p>Proyek awal TCS, sebelumnya bernama Chocobot Guardian. Pemeriksa manual tautan dan kualitas halaman website dengan status demo fungsional/pra-produksi.</p></div><a class=\"button button-small button-secondary\" href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/products/tcs-linkguard/\">Detail <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article>\n<article class=\"project-row\"><span class=\"project-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">OS</span><div class=\"project-copy\"><h3>Pengembangan open-source</h3><p>Lisensi kode, panduan kontribusi, pemeriksaan keamanan, dan proses review ditentukan pada masing-masing repositori.</p></div><a class=\"button button-small button-secondary\" href=\"https://github.com/TheChocoStudiosSub\">Repositori <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article>\n<article class=\"project-row\"><span class=\"project-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">PR</span><div class=\"project-copy\"><h3>Proses kontribusi</h3><p>Kontributor tetap memegang hak atas karya sesuai lisensi. Pengajuan tidak otomatis memberi status sebagai pemilik, pegawai, mitra, atau pengelola TCS.</p></div><a class=\"button button-small button-secondary\" href=\"https://the-choco-studios-official.vercel.app/bergabung/\">Panduan bergabung <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article>\n</div></div></section>","encoding":"utf-8"}}